# ===[ MLflow ]================================================================
- `mlflow` is python library that allows you to track and manager your machine
  learning experiments.


            +-----------------[ MLflow ]-----------------+
            |                                            |
      [ Experiment ]                                  [ Run ]
  - Is the set of 'runs'                      - Is a single run/test
    that generate `metrics`,                    with different parameters  
    `artifacts`, `parameters`                   etc, ...
    about a ML subject
    (regression/classification)


